epictetus-3.md:1: argue/readings: S8 is read 2 ways: epictetus-3.logic.r1 and epictetus-3.logic.r1.2 have nothing from it; epictetus-3.logic.r1.3 has "¬can_eject"; they differ when only "some man can eject me out of the world" is true, which the first allows
epictetus-3.md:1: argue/answered: S8: answered no, which keeps epictetus-3.logic.r1.3, to: Suppose "some man can eject me out of the world" is true. Is S8, "He cannot.", true then?
